# Every engine's image build context is the repository root, filtered down to what its Dockerfile
# copies: the engine's configuration, what `megasamples image` staged under build/<engine>/image/, and
# the licence files that must travel with the data. Everything else is repository weight.
*
!engines/mysql/my.cnf
!engines/mysql/init/
!engines/mysql/entrypoint-wrapper.sh
!build/mysql/image/
!engines/postgres/init/
!engines/postgres/entrypoint-wrapper.sh
!build/postgres/image/
!build/sqlite/image/
!NOTICE.md
!LICENSES.md
!CATALOGUE.md
!README.md
# The datasets' licence files, re-included through their directory: BuildKit honours a bare
# `!datasets/*/LICENSE` under `*`, Buildah (Podman's builder) does not re-include the parent.
!datasets/
datasets/*/*
!datasets/*/LICENSE
!datasets/*/PROVENANCE.md
